# Git remote — jacobrozell SSH

This repo is under the **jacobrozell** personal GitHub account. Do not use the default `github.com` SSH host (work key `jrozellOCV`).

## Required remote

```text
origin  git@github.com-personal:jacobrozell/League-Keeper-iOS.git
```

SSH alias `github.com-personal` is in `~/.ssh/config` and uses `~/.ssh/id_ed25519_github_jacobrozell`.

## Before push / PR

1. Verify remote: `git remote -v`
2. If origin is `git@github.com:jacobrozell/...`, fix it:
   ```bash
   git remote set-url origin git@github.com-personal:jacobrozell/League-Keeper-iOS.git
   ```
3. Test auth if needed: `ssh -T git@github.com-personal` → `Hi jacobrozell!`

## Push failures

If push fails with `Permission denied to jrozellOCV`, the wrong SSH identity is in use — reset `origin` to `github.com-personal` as above.
